      {
        "name": "just below",
        "code": "assert gets_voucher(99999) == False",
        "hidden": true
      }
    ],
    "solution": "def gets_voucher(total_spent):\n    return total_spent >= 100000\n"
  },
  "evidence": {
    "required": [],
    "supporting": []
  },
  "explanation": "The > sign means \"more than\", so exactly Rp100,000 does not pass. \"At least\" means more than or equal to, which is >=.",
